Column name: user_first_touch_timestamp Type: INT64 Description: The sequential ID of the bundle in which these events were uploaded.
Column name: user_ltv Type: STRUCT<revenue FLOAT64, currency STRING> Description: Timestamp offset between collection time and upload time in micros.
Column name: device Type: STRUCT<category STRING, mobile_brand_name STRING, mobile_model_name STRING, mobile_marketing_name STRING, mobile_os_hardware_model INT64, operating_system STRING, operating_system_version STRING, vendor_id INT64, advertising_id INT64, language STRING, is_limited_ad_tracking STRING, time_zone_offset_seconds INT64, web_info STRUCT<browser STRING, browser_version STRING>> Description: The unique ID assigned to a user.
Column name: geo Type: STRUCT<continent STRING, sub_continent STRING, country STRING, region STRING, city STRING, metro STRING> Description: The pseudonymous id (e.g., app instance ID) for the user.
Column name: app_info Type: STRUCT<id STRING, version STRING, install_store STRING, firebase_app_id STRING, install_source STRING> Description: The privacy_info fields contain information based on the consent status of a user when consent mode is enabled.
Column name: traffic_source Type: STRUCT<medium STRING, name STRING, source STRING> Description: Whether Analytics storage is enabled for the user. Possible values: Yes, No, Unset
Column name: stream_id Type: INT64 Description: Whether ad targeting is enabled for a user. Possible values: Yes, No, Unset
Column name: platform Type: STRING Description: Whether a web user has denied Analytics storage and the developer has enabled measurement without cookies based on transient tokens in server data. Possible values: Yes, No, Unset
Column name: event_dimensions Type: STRUCT<hostname STRING> Description: The user_properties RECORD contains any user properties that you have set. It is repeated for each key that is associated with a user.
Column name: ecommerce Type: STRUCT<total_item_quantity INT64, purchase_revenue_in_usd FLOAT64, purchase_revenue FLOAT64, refund_value_in_usd FLOAT64, refund_value FLOAT64, shipping_value_in_usd FLOAT64, shipping_value FLOAT64, tax_value_in_usd FLOAT64, tax_value FLOAT64, unique_items INT64, transaction_id STRING> Description: The name of the user property.
Column name: items Type: ARRAY<STRUCT<item_id STRING, item_name STRING, item_brand STRING, item_variant STRING, item_category STRING, item_category2 STRING, item_category3 STRING, item_category4 STRING, item_category5 STRING, price_in_usd FLOAT64, price FLOAT64, quantity INT64, item_revenue_in_usd FLOAT64, item_revenue FLOAT64, item_refund_in_usd FLOAT64, item_refund FLOAT64, coupon STRING, affiliation STRING, location_id STRING, item_list_id STRING, item_list_name STRING, item_list_index STRING, promotion_id STRING, promotion_name STRING, creative_name STRING, creative_slot STRING>> Description: A record for the user property value.
